{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/557016-secret-of-the-covenants-question","id":557016,"title":"Secret of the Covenants question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-16T09:52:26-07:00","id":557016,"title":"Secret of the Covenants question","content":"Is there going to be some info on VII, Belial's Brood, Tenth Choir or Gallows Post? Legion of the Dead or some other small covenants we haven't heard of before?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1191-rosencroft","name":"Rosencroft","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T10:08:00-07:00","id":557046,"title":"","content":"We've been told Belial's Brood is in some or one of the stories in <i>Secrets of the Covenants </i>but that's it, I think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T10:20:30-07:00","id":557049,"title":"","content":"From the looks of a certain Theban ritual in the preview, they might have been reduced into a Lancea heresy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T10:34:31-07:00","id":557050,"title":"","content":"What ritual?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1191-rosencroft","name":"Rosencroft","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T10:47:00-07:00","id":557054,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZXnaJDf-gERGZe97JoIqj2bffJyrjal8Ch4xWD4L9lg/edit?pli=1\" target=\"_blank\">Pledge to the Worthless One</a>. I'm hoping that, like the original Belial's Brood, there's more than one group that's lumped under the name. I worry that with the inclusion of the strix and idigam as antagonists, there will be less emphasis on fleshing out intra-game antagonists like Belial's Brood. It's an overreaction, and I admit there's no real reason to think that but between talk of developers not wanting villainous splats to be playable and things like the Brood not appearing in the core book I just can't help but freak out at the thought of my favorite parts of the game being removed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T10:53:35-07:00","id":557056,"title":"","content":"I would imagine there will be at least some word count on VII, though that hasn't been confirmed. I would also not worry too much about Belial's Brood being &quot;reduced&quot; to a Lancea heresy. It's looking very much like at least one faction of the Brood will be, but I'd be very surprised if that's all there is to them. I don't expect to see much in the way of lost Covenants like the Gallows Post or the Legio Mortum, but we will definitely at least be getting some juicy stuff on Gallows Post in Dark Eras.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T10:56:38-07:00","id":557058,"title":"","content":"Belial's Brood is not a Lancea et Sanctum heresy, although there are some areas where both would be uncomfortable with the overlap. VII is likewise still its own thing. Both have mentions but not significant roles in SotC.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 06-16-2015, 03:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T10:58:57-07:00","id":557061,"title":"","content":"It would be cool to see stuff with the Legion of the Dead, too. Cursed artifacts are too few and far between in Requiem.<br /> <br /> And like I said, I know it's irrational. I've just really enjoyed the second edition of Vampire and Werewolf both and it's easy for someone like myself to slip into the, 'It's too good to be true,' trap where you start wondering what the price is. They've even said the Brood were just left out for space and still exist, and Werewolf writers have shown interest in writing up Bale Hounds and Pure.<br /> <br /> I like the pledge, too. Gaining the bonuses of frenzy is really powerful, and inability to use touchstones is a nice compromise. Really captures some of the frenetic, 'live fast, die young,' lifestyle of vampires who don't appreciate their immortality yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-16-2015, 02:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}